  "title": "U.S. President Trump’s Asia Trip Includes Meeting with Russia and China Leaders",
  "summary": "The U.S. president plans to meet with Russia’s Vladimir Putin and China’s President Xi Jinping during a one-day Asia trip starting in the Philippines, followed by a two-day summit in Shenzhen. These visits aim to address regional security and economic cooperation.",
